      "lint_clean": true,
      "parent": "bob",
      "summary": "Bob — Telegram-native companion agent: GUPPI process, LLM Tier 0/1 router with privacy redaction, SQLite+FTS5 memory, Higher Mind, Genesis, heartbeat. Two admin bots in one process (BOB-003): a MultiBotGateway (BotRegistry) polls both Bob and GUPPI, dedups cross-bot by (chat_id, message_id), and a central router dispatches by identity+scope — Bob lives in his forum topic, GUPPI is the gatekeeper in General with a visible unauthorized reject + owner commands. aiogram transport (native draft streaming + Rich Messages), owner/allowlist/chat-scope authz, resilient ticks, and a capability seam (registry + tool-loop) executed by GUPPI.",
      "symbols": 1117,
      "url": "/services/bob"
    },
